{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2021-05-26 16:20:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR FIRST QUARTER FISCAL 2022', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MAY 26, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) TODAY REPORTED RECORD REVENUE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MAY 2, 2021, OF $5.66 BILLION, UP 84 PERCENT FROM A YEAR EARLIER AND UP 13 PERCENT FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER, WITH RECORD REVENUE FROM THE COMPANY'S GAMING, DATA CENTER AND PROFESSIONAL VISUALIZATION PLATFORMS."}